## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical, beginner-friendly design across edge and cloud, data residency, security, and cost—covering IoT Hub, IoT Edge, Functions, SQL with RBAC/RLS, and Power BI, plus BYOK and DR.

## Key Concepts

- IoT Edge integration with IoT Hub
- Edge sampling/filtering
- Serverless enrichment with Functions
- Data partitioning and Row-Level Security in Azure SQL
- BYOK with Key Vault
- Data residency in EU
- DR planning and cost management

## Code Example

```javascript
module.exports = async function (context, eventHubMessages) {
  const enriched = eventHubMessages.map(m => ({
    deviceId: m.properties?.deviceId || m.systemProperties['iothub-connection-device-id'],
    timestamp: m.body?.timestamp || new Date().toISOString(),
    tempC: m.body?.tempC
  }));
  context.log(`Enriched ${enriched.length} messages`);
  // Pseudo: insert into Azure SQL using a managed identity
  return enriched;
}
```

